<title>BELGIUM: BBL TO STRIP VVPR SHARES.</title>
<headline>BBL TO STRIP VVPR SHARES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Banque Bruxelles Lambert (BBL) said in a statement on Thursday that it plans to strip its VVPR shares.</p>
<p>Practical details of the operation will be released by year-end.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
